      "text": "Osman I B, Hugonnot V, Muller S D, Daoud-Bouattour A, felipe (2021). Four bryophytes collected in Tunisia, new for mainland Africa. Cryptogamie, Bryologie. Checklist dataset https://doi.org/10.15468/4uzwrs accessed via GBIF.org on 2026-09-15.",
